From 0028e43c9c0af25027e0fb4bde3f9288e3cc7700 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roger Luethi <luethi@osism.tech>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:18:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] nova: do not sleep on nova-scheduler shutdown

On 2026.1, SchedulerManager.graceful_shutdown() sleeps for
manager_shutdown_timeout (160s by default) as a stand-in for task
tracking. The scheduler has nothing to wait for at that point:
select_destinations runs inside the RPC dispatch, and Service.stop()
has already drained in-flight dispatches with rpc_server.wait() before
it calls graceful_shutdown().

The sleep hurts on reload. refresh_scheduler_cell_cache.yml sends
SIGHUP to nova_scheduler on all scheduler hosts at once, on every nova
deploy and reconfigure. With the oslo.service threading backend,
cotyledon turns that SIGHUP into a stop and respawn of every worker.
Each worker stops consuming first and then sleeps, so the scheduler
topic has no consumer for about 160s and select_destinations calls
made in that window can time out.

Set manager_shutdown_timeout = 0 for nova-scheduler only. The option
also controls the shutdown wait of nova-compute and nova-conductor,
where it lets in-progress operations such as live migrations finish,
so those keep the default. Operators can override the value in
nova/nova-scheduler.conf.

Nova master replaces the sleep with task tracking, where the option
becomes the timeout for in-progress tasks and 0 would skip that wait.
The patch is therefore limited to 2026.1. Drop it if task tracking or
another fix for the sleep reaches stable/2026.1.

Signed-off-by: Roger Luethi <luethi@osism.tech>
Upstream-Status: Pending
Related: https://review.opendev.org/c/openstack/nova/+/996299 (nova master task tracking; drop this patch if it reaches stable/2026.1)
Related: https://review.opendev.org/c/openstack/nova/+/1000211 (nova master executor shutdown, same series)
---
 ansible/roles/nova/templates/nova.conf.j2 | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ansible/roles/nova/templates/nova.conf.j2 b/ansible/roles/nova/templates/nova.conf.j2
index 89eb4fe52..e17e53c65 100644
--- a/ansible/roles/nova/templates/nova.conf.j2
+++ b/ansible/roles/nova/templates/nova.conf.j2
@@ -12,6 +12,10 @@ log_file = /var/log/kolla/nova/nova-metadata.log
 log_dir = /var/log/kolla/nova
 {% endif %}
 
+{% if service_name == "nova-scheduler" %}
+manager_shutdown_timeout = 0
+{% endif %}
+
 state_path = /var/lib/nova
 allow_resize_to_same_host = true
 
